{"title":"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> be integers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3afcb3ae698b232912beaad990c9e80781672b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 &lt; m \\le 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"94\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a9078548a7167fe92632e8e9d74e94639f240a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m &lt; n \\le 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"102\" height=\"15\" />. Given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/6/0f697eae3bb5180fba554d9b23510c904b039faf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\log_m{n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/a/c2a6632ff5742d435f382d5923349abdd1070b5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = \\log_n{m}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />, find the number of ordered pairs <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca10ffe3531cf1faf6222be7eac407c47bef878.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m,n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"51\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/8/f88214bcd0a67add714363d84d26d19ec9f851ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor x \\rfloor = \\lceil y \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"19\" />. (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/5/4557d136477be7dedade03795960d759e03c80eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lfloor a \\rfloor$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"22\" height=\"19\" /> is the greatest integer less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/3/8338bebc2a84d457bd0eae5f4100834b0b28aaa1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\lceil a \\rceil$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"22\" height=\"19\" /> is the least integer greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006\">Mock AIME 5 2005-2006</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems\">Problems</a></b>, <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/viewtopic.php?t=76847\">Source</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mock_AIME_5_2005-2006_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"Mock AIME 5 2005-2006 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title